Generally you are talking about items that are a low low percentage chance
to be generated. 

Do me a favor. Talk a minute about the perceived necessity of these items.

Next there is a guaranteed WoW at the castle. So that's a minimum of 4
wishes that you can use for critical items.


> 	I've quit on all my best characters because I reach this point and
