Quitting I believe. In nethack there is virtually always more than one way
to pull off an ascension.

Also while boring, generally anything you need can be generated by pudding
farming. It's a bit painful to pull off. But a level full of puddings can 
generate a ton of stuff.

Don't give up. Next time you get stuck, come back here and describe your
problem. I'll bet you'll get an alternative solution that'll keep you moving.

